\begin{MintedVerbatim}[commandchars=\\\{\}]
Program      ::= TopLevel* EOF
TopLevel     ::= EntryDecl | ExternDecl | FuncDef

EntryDecl    ::= \PYGZdq{}\PYGZdl{}ENTRY\PYGZdq{} Ident \PYGZdq{};\PYGZdq{}
               | \PYGZdq{}\PYGZdl{}ENTRY\PYGZdq{} Ident \PYGZdq{}\PYGZob{}\PYGZdq{} Rule+ \PYGZdq{}\PYGZcb{}\PYGZdq{}
ExternDecl   ::= \PYGZdq{}\PYGZdl{}EXTERN\PYGZdq{} Ident (\PYGZdq{},\PYGZdq{} Ident)* \PYGZdq{};\PYGZdq{}
FuncDef      ::= Ident \PYGZdq{}\PYGZob{}\PYGZdq{} Rule+ \PYGZdq{}\PYGZcb{}\PYGZdq{}

Rule         ::= Pattern \PYGZdq{}=\PYGZdq{} Result \PYGZdq{};\PYGZdq{}?

Pattern      ::= PatternTerm*
PatternTerm  ::= Int | Str | QuotedSym
               | \PYGZdq{}(\PYGZdq{} PatternTerm* \PYGZdq{})\PYGZdq{}
               | Var | Ident

Result       ::= ResultTerm*
ResultTerm   ::= Int | Str | QuotedSym
               | \PYGZdq{}(\PYGZdq{} ResultTerm* \PYGZdq{})\PYGZdq{}
               | \PYGZdq{}\PYGZlt{}\PYGZdq{} Ident ResultTerm* \PYGZdq{}\PYGZgt{}\PYGZdq{}
               | Var | Ident

Var          ::= (\PYGZdq{}s\PYGZdq{} | \PYGZdq{}t\PYGZdq{} | \PYGZdq{}e\PYGZdq{}) \PYGZdq{}.\PYGZdq{} VarName
\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} s. \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} single atom variable (not brackets)
\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} t. \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} term variable (any single term)
\PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} e. \PYGZhy{}\PYGZhy{} expression variable (0 or more terms)
\end{MintedVerbatim}
